## 0. Point of Departure\
\
This document begins with a negative result.\
\
Two systematic reviews searched the NEXAH ecosystem for an admissible new\
mathematical question.\
\
The result was:\
\
```text\
SERIES I  \uc0\u8594   ZERO\
SERIES II \uc0\u8594   ZERO\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 \strokec3 ZERO does not mean that nothing exists.\
It means that no new mathematical object, theorem or research question survived\uc0\u8232 the declared filters.\
Existing mathematics remained sufficient.\
Protocols, experiments, visual systems, observations and architectures remained\uc0\u8232 real and valuable \'97 but they did not constitute new mathematics.\
This result changes the direction of inquiry.\
The next question is no longer:\
\strokec3 What new mathematics does NEXAH contain?\strokec3 \
It becomes:\
\strokec3 What architecture repeatedly produces mathematical, visual, linguistic,\strokec3 \uc0\u8232 \strokec3 computational and experimental descriptions?\strokec3 \
