\f2\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 5. Grouping\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec3 Perception groups.\
The brain does not present every available signal with equal weight.\
It produces stable descriptions:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs26 \cf0 \strokec3 \
millions of edges\
millions of colours\
millions of movements\
\uc0\u8595 \
TREE\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

