\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs26 \cf0 \strokec3 \
many trees\
light\
humidity\
sound\
movement\
terrain\
\uc0\u8595 \
FOREST\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 \strokec3 A category is therefore a compression.\
Compression removes detail but creates orientation.\
This suggests an important distinction:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs26 \cf0 \strokec3 \
more information \uc0\u8800  more orientation\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

