\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 reveal pressure;\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 produce a new accessible path.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec3 The architectural point is simpler:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec3 A visible event may be the surface trace of an already existing internal\strokec3 \uc0\u8232 \strokec3 organization.\strokec3 \
