\f2\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec3 21. G\'f6del Boundary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec3 G\'f6del's work should not be used here as a general proof that all description is\uc0\u8232 impossible or circular.\
The relevant inspiration is narrower:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec3 A formal descriptive system has limits on what it can establish entirely\strokec3 \uc0\u8232 \strokec3 within its own declared rules.\strokec3 \
NEXAH repeatedly reaches a related architectural boundary:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs26 \cf0 \strokec3 \
