\uc0\u8595 \
description of the description\
\uc0\u8595 \
description of how descriptions are generated\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 \strokec3 At some point, the observer, reference, language or authority must itself be\uc0\u8232 declared.\
The problem is not solved by adding another symbol indefinitely.\
The system must expose its own boundary.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

