\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec3 Before a structure is formalized mathematically, it may already exist as an\strokec3 \uc0\u8232 \strokec3 architecture of distinctions, relations, layers, interfaces and transitions.\strokec3 \
This does not establish an architecture outside mathematics as an objective\uc0\u8232 metaphysical entity.\
It describes the practical order of discovery:\
