\'95 Memory\
\'95 Emergence\
\
---\
\
# Immediate Next Steps\
\
Create an Operator Atlas.\
\
Each primitive receives:\
\
- visual definition\
- geometric construction\
- possible combinations\
- dynamic behaviour\
- embodiment examples\
- appearances in existing visual systems\
\
Examples:\
\
Operator 001\
Observer\
\
Operator 002\
Boundary\
\
Operator 003\
Horizon\
\
Operator 004\
Aperture\
\
...\
\
This would become the foundation for a reusable visual grammar across Orion.\
\
