# ORION SEED \'97 OVS v0.1\
\
## Purpose\
\
This package preserves the first bounded formulation of OVS:\
Orientation Visual Syntax.\
\
It does not define a new specification and does not modify OLS.\
\
## Reading rule\
\
Every visual must distinguish:\
\
1. primitive operator;\
2. composition;\
3. behaviour;\
4. realization;\
5. cultural or historical provenance.\
\
A visual resemblance does not establish common origin, identity, scientific\
equivalence or normative meaning.\
\
## Core sentence\
\
> Do not collect symbols. Extract operators.\
\
